Z||000000||Haagster||10-23-2001||11:59 AM||||Got my 87GT back (again) from the shop this morning.  For the first time since I got the car, there doesn't seem to be anything "major" to fix (although the AC needs to be replaced/repaired next spring...).  It doesn't leak oil, coolant, or transmission fluid everywhere it sits.  The water pump, oil pump, egr tube, solenoid, vac lines, O2 sensor, fuel pump relay, temp. sender, etc etc etc all replaced.  The service engine light is not "On" constantly.  The performance sound is cooperating with my Alpine stereo.<P>Life is good.<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature_8.jpg">   <BR>87GT Auto||||reg||14
